{"id":"2e4e495c5c3c9961","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness.md","title":"NJ与NK的开放判断经典可靠性","display":"thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness — NJ与NK的开放判断经典可靠性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness","aliases":["72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness"],"display":"thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness — NJ与NK的开放判断经典可靠性","depends_on":["[[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]]","[[72-df-abstract-rule-validity]]","[[72-thm-well-founded-proof-soundness]]","[[72-lem-semantic-substitution]]","[[72-lem-semantic-locality]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.4.8, print47–48/PDF59–60; local rule-by-rule proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness — NJ与NK的开放判断经典可靠性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a339e72892676e7\" href=\"?note=5a339e72892676e7\" title=\"72-df-natural-deduction-validity\">72-df-natural-deduction-validity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e2d6ae13554de5c2\" href=\"?note=e2d6ae13554de5c2\" title=\"72-df-abstract-rule-validity\">72-df-abstract-rule-validity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"73245f799abb8dc9\" href=\"?note=73245f799abb8dc9\" title=\"72-thm-well-founded-proof-soundness\">72-thm-well-founded-proof-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b286b5d2520ff936\" href=\"?note=b286b5d2520ff936\" title=\"72-lem-semantic-substitution\">72-lem-semantic-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"102b16872a6480ee\" href=\"?note=102b16872a6480ee\" title=\"72-lem-semantic-locality\">72-lem-semantic-locality</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.4.8, print47–48/PDF59–60; local rule-by-rule proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\\in\\{\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma,\\mathbf{NK}_\\Sigma\\}\">\\(\\mathcal D\\in\\{\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma,\\mathbf{NK}_\\Sigma\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\">\\(\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\\)</span>。所有假设解除与本征变量条件均取实际自然演绎规则，不额外增添理论公理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathcal D}(\\mathcal V^N_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathcal D}(\\mathcal V^N_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal D}\\quad\\operatorname{NDValid}_\\Sigma(\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal D}\\quad\\operatorname{NDValid}_\\Sigma(\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>假设叶有效。→I：满足解除后假设并使 A 真时，也满足原假设，前提推出 B；空解除仍成立。∨E 分析真析取所选分支，使用对应的已解除假设。∃E 取一个见证，把本征变量赋该值；新鲜性和局部性保证剩余假设及结论真值不变。∀I 在全部赋值下使用前提并任改新鲜变量，代入引理给量词结论。其余引入消去规则逐真值验证；RAA 在经典结构中由否定假设导致矛盾推出 A。最后应用有限证明树可靠性。此结论不将 NJ 的经典可靠性称为直觉主义 Kripke 完备性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-natural-deduction-validity","status":"resolved","id":"5a339e72892676e7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-abstract-rule-validity","status":"resolved","id":"e2d6ae13554de5c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-abstract-rule-validity]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-well-founded-proof-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"73245f799abb8dc9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-well-founded-proof-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-semantic-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"b286b5d2520ff936","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-semantic-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-semantic-locality","status":"resolved","id":"102b16872a6480ee","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-semantic-locality]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal D\\in\\{\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma,\\mathbf{NK}_\\Sigma\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathcal D}(\\mathcal V^N_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal D}\\quad\\operatorname{NDValid}_\\Sigma(\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).","display":true}],"bytes":2022,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property]] · [[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]] · [[72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness]] · [[72-thm-propositional-compactness]] · [[72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property]] · [[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]] · [[72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness]] · [[72-thm-propositional-compactness]] · [[72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,